<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom said rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom said rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers started coverage of Viacom Inc as buy with a price target of $42, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Class B shares ended at 35-3/4 Tuesday.</p>
</text>
